  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a vibrant haven with the Jeminise Softball Sports Comforter Set. Designed for ultimate comfort and style, this ultra-soft comforter set features a dynamic softball theme, perfect for athletes and fans alike, and is available for personalization to make it uniquely yours.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Theme:</strong> Celebrate your passion for softball with a spirited design that brings energy and inspiration to your space.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm), this comforter offers a soft, smooth, and durable feel for a restful night's sleep.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durable &amp; Fade-Resistant:</strong> The superior manufacturing process uses environmental protection techniques to ensure the fabric holds onto dye, preventing fading and ensuring long-lasting vibrancy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to perfectly fit your bed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes a soft and comfortable comforter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This comforter is machine washable and dries quickly; tumble dry low for convenient maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization:</strong> Personalize your comforter with 2 text inputs for a unique touch.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Twin/Full/Queen/King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses for Product</th>\n<td>Napping, Reading, Travel</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
